    "  - vitest  website/src/test/folderRank.test.ts   (website/src/utils/folderRank.ts)",
    "The gateway computes every stored rank; the sidebar computes the same keys only",
    "to draw a drag before the server answers, so both must produce identical keys",
    "and sort identically."
